    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald are thrilled to present Apt 4 Thormanby Court. This top floor, 2 Bedroom Apartment overlooking the amazing Howth harbour, is a fantastic opportunity to put roots down in one of the most sought after areas of Dublin.\n\nThe apartment comes to the market in fantastic condition, having been well looked after and upgraded by the current owners. The property is soaked in natural light and surrounded by views of the harbour and Irelands Eye. The property also has the benefit of vaulted ceilings stretching to 3.7metres in height. Outside the property, is a fantastic shared green space for residents.\n\n\nAccommodation consists of a spacious hallway, main bedroom with ensuite, family bathroom, second bedroom & open plan kitchen, dining and living area.\n\nOnly a short stroll from the picturesque fishing village of Howth with an abundance of local amenities including schools, boutique shops, greengrocers, fine dining restaurants and gastro-bars. Along with a selection of walking and hiking trails along the harbour, the coast, the cliff and across the hill. Howth is also well positioned on both bus and train lines to&from Dublin City Centre. Plus, Dublin Airport is close by."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 4.5m x 1.4m\nLaminated timber effect floor.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.6m x 3.20m\nFinished with carpet flooring and a tv point.\n\nEnsuite - 2.2m x .8m\nBathroom featuring a WHB, wc, bath and finished with tiled floor.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.6m x 2.2\nFinished with carpet flooring and fitted sliding wardrobe.\n\nKitchen - 4m x 1.65m\nA bright fitted kitchen, oven, hob, extractor fan, integrated fridge / freezer, and dishwasher finished with tiled floor, a tiled splashback and recess lighting.\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 7m x 4m\nLaminated timber effect floor, tv point, full length windows with sea views to Ireland's eye\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Top Floor Apartment</li><li>New Combi Gas Boiler</li><li>Ceiling Height 3.7m</li><li>Excellent Condition</li><li>Off Street Parking</li><li>Walking Distance to Howth Village</li><li>Service Charge 1,627 per year</ul>"
      },
